&lt;li&gt;You have experience in helping new teams form, setting them up for success and helping them gel effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data and hypothesis-driven approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to manage and collaborate with product, technology, UX and functional stakeholders from Operations, Risk and Growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate complexity quickly to solve seemingly impossible challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
