&lt;li&gt;Expert-level conflict mediation and facilitation skills, capable of navigating high-stakes discussions at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A very strong toolkit consisting of various flavours of Agile methodologies with a focus on applying them in a framework-agnostic manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in driving organizational agility and large-scale cultural transformations in tech-led environments.&lt;/li&gt;
