&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have experience with using CRM system (ideally Salesforce) and&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;experience with process management tools like Jira and Confluence is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You use your time effectively, can prioritise appropriately and are able to work under strict deadlines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are committed and eager to learn and want to drive the improvement and optimisation of our processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
