&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good presentation skills and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having experience in high growth startups managing topics like Fraud or AFC would be a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having experience in quantitative research would be a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having experience in fintech would be a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
