&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you will supporting the FP&amp;amp;A team and Finance, People and Product stakeholders by building financial and operational models, designing actionable dashboards, and translating planning needs into tool configurations. With a focus on managing the day-to-day administration, maintenance, and governance of the planning and reporting platform, Pigment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
