&lt;li&gt;Expertise in governance tooling and collaboration platforms (e.g., JIRA, Confluence, FigJam).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive communication skills, including board-ready reporting and presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required; German (fluent or basic) preferred, with willingness to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
