&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly motivated and resourceful Senior Specialist, Affiliate &amp;amp; Influencers to join our team and lead our expansion in the Spanish market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for a results-driven professional who is eager to manage complex external partnerships and drive user acquisition while maintaining a high-impact, operational mindset across all performance marketing channels. You will join a high-performance team where you will be expected to manage everything from strategic negotiations to technical troubleshooting in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influencer and Affiliates Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary focus will be defining, optimizing and executing our Affiliate and Influencer marketing strategy, ensuring total alignment with our business goals and local market nuances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day operations of the Spanish Affiliate and Influencer network, including pipeline building, relationship management, negotiation, and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct data-driven research and analysis to support decision-making and provide the insights needed to scale channel performance. This includes deep dive analysis on acquisition rates, costs, profitability, product penetration and long term retention,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the reporting of channel performance, key insights, and strategic plans during weekly and monthly growth steering meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define and improve marketing processes related to partnership tracking, attribution, and payout/budgeting for the Spanish market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure content compliance and internal rules and controls processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and execute ad-hoc growth initiatives to drive user and revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage co-marketing campaigns with strategic business partners to expand reach and acquire new audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and coordinate offline growth initiatives, including traditional media placements, displays, and event activations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead social media collaborations with key partners to increase brand visibility and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate content creation with external subject-matter experts and speakers to build public brand awareness and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;identify and execute new growth opportunities&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;and experimental initiatives that support overall marketing and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; +5 years of experience within high-paced marketing agencies or performance marketing roles, demonstrating a resourceful and versatile marketing background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specialized Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 2 years of direct experience managing Affiliate and Influencer Marketing programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of independently building and scaling new partner relationships specifically within the Spanish market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in data visualization tools (e.g., Tableau, Looker, or PowerBI) and advanced Excel/Google Sheets skills (Pivot tables, VLOOKUPs, data modeling) to audit partner performance and attribution models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Grit:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to negotiate and structure diverse commercial deals, including CPA, CPL, fee structures, and commission tiers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linguistic Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional fluency in Spanish is required; fluency in English is essential for collaboration with our international team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The &quot;Plus&quot;:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in fintech or banking is a significant advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
