&lt;h2&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you ready for your next career step? N26 is looking for a Manager Risk Controlling to further develop the risk controlling function at a cutting-edge technology-driven bank. In this role you will establish risk management and controlling tools and drive the development of risk models as well as the implementation of latest regulations. You will take a key role in assessing, controlling and reporting N26s risks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the further development of N26 risk management in order to accommodate N26 growth and risk leadership aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the implementation and adherence to regulatory requirements for risk controlling (e.g. MaRisk, ICAAP guidelines, EBA guidelines, MaSan, SAG).&lt;/li&gt;
